# Synthetic whole-case draft; not admitted or executable.
Choreoform authoring "0.7.0".
Process "Expense reimbursement".
Start at "Review again".
Inputs ["Claim" uses "Current claim", "Payment due" uses "Payment due"]. Outputs ["Disposition" uses "Disposition", "Payable" uses "Payable reference"]. Outcomes ["paid", "rejected", "problem"].
Use cancellation "Withdraw request", faults "Unhandled faults", closure "Preserve remaining work" and races "Acceptance order".
Require actor "Employee" under "Employee authority".
Rule for actor "Employee authority". Permit when (((the fact "roles") contains ("expense.employee")) and ((the fact "relationships") contains ("request.submitter"))). End policy.
Require actor "Manager" under "Manager authority".
Rule for actor "Manager authority". Permit when ((the fact "roles") contains ("expense.manager")). End policy.
Require actor "Finance reviewer" under "Finance reviewer authority".
Rule for actor "Finance reviewer authority". Permit when ((the fact "roles") contains ("expense.finance")). End policy.
Require actor "Payment operator" under "Payment operator authority".
Rule for actor "Payment operator authority". Permit when ((the fact "roles") contains ("expense.operator")). End policy.
Require actor "Clock observer" under "Clock observer authority".
Rule for actor "Clock observer authority". Permit when ((the fact "roles") contains ("expense.clock")). End policy.
Require actor "Keep the deadline fixed" under "No deadline extension".
Rule for actor "No deadline extension". Permit when (false). End policy.
Rule for protection "Expense access". Permit access when ((the fact "purpose") equals ("reimbursement")). End policy.
Rule for settlement "Settle children". Unfinished work cancel. End policy.
Rule for cancel "Stop work". Authority "Payment operator". For children use "Settle children". End policy.
Rule for cancel "Withdraw request". Authority "Employee". For children use "Settle children". End policy.
Rule for faults "Unhandled faults". Handle empty. End policy.
Rule for closure "Ordinary close". Fully terminal. End policy.
Rule for race "Acceptance order". Accept in acceptance order. End policy.
Rule for closure "Preserve remaining work". Reconcile in "Remaining work". End policy.
Scope "Remaining work" within "Expense reimbursement".
Start at "Release remaining owner".
Inputs empty. Outputs empty. Outcomes ["complete"].
Use cancellation "Stop work", faults "Unhandled faults", closure "Ordinary close" and races "Acceptance order".
Step "Release remaining owner". Finish as "complete".  End step.
End scope.
Use capability "Check the claim" from "Claim checks provider" with input type "Claim" from "Expense types" and output choice with ["clear" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "correction" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "duplicate" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "rejected" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types"], authority "Payment operator" and effects "Claim checks effects".
Rule for effect "Claim checks effects". Effect is read-only. Idempotency is none. Reconcile under "Claim checks reconciliation". End policy.
Rule for wait "Claim checks reconciliation". Observe choice with ["confirmed" as choice with ["clear" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "correction" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "duplicate" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "rejected" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types"], "noeffect" as record with ["logical effect" as text, "request digest" as text, "observation" as text], "rejected" as record with ["logical effect" as text, "request digest" as text, "observation" as text], "cancelled" as record with ["logical effect" as text, "request digest" as text, "observation" as text]]. Match when (true). Authority "Payment operator". Timer none. On observation outcome "observed" of "Observe Claim checks" in "Claim checks recovery" in "Claim checks" in "Review cycle" in "Expense reimbursement". On timer none. End policy.
Use capability "Create the payable" from "Payment provider" with input record with ["claim" as type "Claim" from "Expense types", "manager" as type "Review evidence" from "Expense types", "finance" as type "Review evidence" from "Expense types"] and output choice with ["paid" as type "Paid evidence" from "Expense types", "problem" as type "Problem evidence" from "Expense types"], authority "Payment operator" and effects "Payment effects".
Rule for effect "Payment effects". Effect is irreversible. Idempotency is stable-key. Reconcile under "Payment reconciliation". End policy.
Rule for wait "Payment reconciliation". Observe choice with ["confirmed" as choice with ["paid" as type "Paid evidence" from "Expense types", "problem" as type "Problem evidence" from "Expense types"], "noeffect" as record with ["logical effect" as text, "request digest" as text, "observation" as text], "rejected" as record with ["logical effect" as text, "request digest" as text, "observation" as text], "cancelled" as record with ["logical effect" as text, "request digest" as text, "observation" as text]]. Match when (true). Authority "Payment operator". Timer none. On observation outcome "observed" of "Observe Payment" in "Payment recovery" in "Payment" in "Expense reimbursement". On timer none. End policy.
Scope "Payment" within "Expense reimbursement".
Start at "Request Payment".
Inputs ["Request" uses "Payable request", "Deadline" uses "Payment deadline"]. Outputs ["Result" uses "Payment outcome"]. Outcomes ["complete"].
Use cancellation "Stop work", faults "Unhandled faults", closure "Payment close" and races "Payment commits".
Rule for closure "Payment close". Reconcile in "Payment recovery". End policy.
Keep "Payable request" as record with ["claim" as type "Claim" from "Expense types", "manager" as type "Review evidence" from "Expense types", "finance" as type "Review evidence" from "Expense types"] under "Expense access".
Sensitivity "expense". Purposes ["Reimbursement"]. Participants ["Employee", "Manager", "Finance reviewer", "Payment operator", "Clock observer"].
Capabilities ["Check the claim", "Create the payable", "Notify the employee"]. Invalidate ["Request Payment" in "Payment" in "Expense reimbursement"]. Initially unavailable. End data.
Keep "Payment outcome" as choice with ["paid" as type "Paid evidence" from "Expense types", "problem" as type "Problem evidence" from "Expense types"] under "Expense access".
Sensitivity "expense". Purposes ["Reimbursement"]. Participants ["Employee", "Manager", "Finance reviewer", "Payment operator", "Clock observer"].
Capabilities ["Check the claim", "Create the payable", "Notify the employee"]. Invalidate empty. Initially unavailable. End data.
Let "Payment input" mean (the value of "Payable request") as record with ["claim" as type "Claim" from "Expense types", "manager" as type "Review evidence" from "Expense types", "finance" as type "Review evidence" from "Expense types"] with parameters empty.
Keep "Payment deadline" as whole number under "Expense access".
Sensitivity "expense". Purposes ["Reimbursement"]. Participants ["Employee", "Manager", "Finance reviewer", "Payment operator", "Clock observer"].
Capabilities ["Check the claim", "Create the payable", "Notify the employee"]. Invalidate ["Request Payment" in "Payment" in "Expense reimbursement"]. Initially unavailable. End data.
Rule for race "Payment commits". Guard commits when (((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (field "manager" of (the value of "Payable request")))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request"))))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (field "manager" of (the value of "Payable request")))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request")))))) and ((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (field "finance" of (the value of "Payable request")))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request"))))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (field "finance" of (the value of "Payable request")))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request")))))) and ((field "revision" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request")))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim")))))) and ((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request")))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim")))) and ((field "policy revision" of (the representation of (field "manager" of (the value of "Payable request")))) equals (field "policy revision" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request")))))) and (((field "policy revision" of (the representation of (field "finance" of (the value of "Payable request")))) equals (field "policy revision" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request"))))) and ((field "policy revision" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request")))) equals (field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim"))))))). End policy.
Rule for work "Payment work". Instructions "Process only this exact request revision. Retain unknown effects; never infer payment or delivery from a request.". Authority "Payment operator". Attempts 2. Delays [1000 microseconds]. Retry faults ["confirmed no effect"]. For retries use clock "Expense clock", basis "Payable request", fault source "Payment faults". Timeout clock "Expense clock", basis "Payment deadline", due (the value of "Payment deadline"), calendar none, pause authority "Keep the deadline fixed". Complete when (if ((the case of (the fact "result")) equals ("paid")) then ((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "paid"))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request"))))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "paid"))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request")))))) and (((field "amount" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "paid"))) equals (field "amount" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request"))))) and ((field "currency" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "paid"))) equals (field "currency" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request"))))))) otherwise (if ((the case of (the fact "result")) equals ("problem")) then (((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "problem"))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request"))))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "problem"))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (field "claim" of (the value of "Payable request")))))) otherwise (false))). Compensates none. End policy.
Step "Request Payment". Request "Create the payable" using "Payment input" under "Payment work" and record in "Payment outcome". On "paid", continue with "Finish Payment". On "problem", continue with "Finish Payment". End step.
Step "Finish Payment". Finish as "complete".  End step.
Scope "Payment recovery" within "Payment".
Start at "Observe Payment".
Inputs empty. Outputs empty. Outcomes ["complete"].
Use cancellation "Stop work", faults "Unhandled faults", closure "Ordinary close" and races "Acceptance order".
Step "Observe Payment". Wait under "Payment reconciliation". On "observed", continue with "Finish Payment recovery". End step.
Step "Finish Payment recovery". Finish as "complete".  End step.
End scope.
End scope.
Use capability "Notify the employee" from "Notice provider" with input record with ["claim ID" as text, "claim revision" as text, "recipient" as text, "disposition" as text, "reasons" as list of text, "payable reference" as optional text] and output choice with ["notified" as type "Notice evidence" from "Expense types"], authority "Payment operator" and effects "Notice effects".
Rule for effect "Notice effects". Effect is irreversible. Idempotency is stable-key. Reconcile under "Notice reconciliation". End policy.
Rule for wait "Notice reconciliation". Observe choice with ["confirmed" as choice with ["notified" as type "Notice evidence" from "Expense types"], "noeffect" as record with ["logical effect" as text, "request digest" as text, "observation" as text], "rejected" as record with ["logical effect" as text, "request digest" as text, "observation" as text], "cancelled" as record with ["logical effect" as text, "request digest" as text, "observation" as text]]. Match when (true). Authority "Payment operator". Timer none. On observation outcome "observed" of "Observe Notice" in "Notice recovery" in "Notice" in "Expense reimbursement". On timer none. End policy.
