Sensitivity "expense". Purposes ["Reimbursement"]. Participants ["Employee", "Manager", "Finance reviewer", "Payment operator", "Clock observer"].
Capabilities ["Check the claim", "Create the payable", "Notify the employee"]. Invalidate empty. Initially unavailable. End data.
Let "Notice input" mean (the value of "Notice request") as record with ["claim ID" as text, "claim revision" as text, "recipient" as text, "disposition" as text, "reasons" as list of text, "payable reference" as optional text] with parameters empty.
Rule for work "Notice work". Instructions "Process only this exact request revision. Retain unknown effects; never infer payment or delivery from a request.". Authority "Payment operator". Attempts 1. Delays empty. Retry faults empty. Timeout none. Complete when (if ((the case of (the fact "result")) equals ("notified")) then ((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "notified"))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the value of "Notice request"))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "notified"))) equals (field "claim revision" of (the value of "Notice request")))) and ((field "recipient" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "notified"))) equals (field "recipient" of (the value of "Notice request")))) otherwise (false)). Compensates none. End policy.
Step "Request Notice". Request "Notify the employee" using "Notice input" under "Notice work" and record in "Notice outcome". On "notified", continue with "Finish Notice". End step.
Step "Finish Notice". Finish as "complete".  End step.
