Capabilities ["Check the claim", "Create the payable", "Notify the employee"]. Invalidate ["Request Claim checks" in "Claim checks" in "Review cycle" in "Expense reimbursement"]. Initially unavailable. End data.
Keep "Check outcome" as choice with ["clear" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "correction" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "duplicate" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "rejected" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types"] under "Expense access".
Sensitivity "expense". Purposes ["Reimbursement"]. Participants ["Employee", "Manager", "Finance reviewer", "Payment operator", "Clock observer"].
Capabilities ["Check the claim", "Create the payable", "Notify the employee"]. Invalidate empty. Initially unavailable. End data.
Let "Claim checks input" mean (the value of "Check request") as type "Claim" from "Expense types" with parameters empty.
Rule for work "Claim checks work". Instructions "Process only this exact request revision. Retain unknown effects; never infer payment or delivery from a request.". Authority "Payment operator". Attempts 1. Delays empty. Retry faults empty. Timeout none. Complete when (if ((the case of (the fact "result")) equals ("clear")) then ((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "clear"))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request")))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "clear"))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request"))))) and ((field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "clear"))) equals (field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request"))))) otherwise (if ((the case of (the fact "result")) equals ("correction")) then ((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "correction"))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request")))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "correction"))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request"))))) and (((field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "correction"))) equals (field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request")))) and ((0) is less than (the length of (field "reasons" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "correction"))))))) otherwise (if ((the case of (the fact "result")) equals ("duplicate")) then (((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "duplicate"))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request")))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "duplicate"))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request"))))) and ((field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "duplicate"))) equals (field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request"))))) and (((0) is less than (the length of (field "reasons" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "duplicate"))))) and (a value exists in (field "duplicate claim" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "duplicate")))))) otherwise (if ((the case of (the fact "result")) equals ("rejected")) then ((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "rejected"))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request")))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "rejected"))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request"))))) and (((field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "rejected"))) equals (field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Check request")))) and ((0) is less than (the length of (field "reasons" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "rejected"))))))) otherwise (false))))). Compensates none. End policy.
Step "Request Claim checks". Request "Check the claim" using "Claim checks input" under "Claim checks work" and record in "Check outcome". On "clear", continue with "Finish Claim checks". On "correction", continue with "Finish Claim checks". On "duplicate", continue with "Finish Claim checks". On "rejected", continue with "Finish Claim checks". End step.
Step "Finish Claim checks". Finish as "complete".  End step.
