Capabilities ["Check the claim", "Create the payable", "Notify the employee"]. Invalidate ["Correct the claim" in "Review cycle" in "Expense reimbursement"]. Initially (list of text containing empty). End data.
Let "Claim for checks" mean (the value of "Current claim") as type "Claim" from "Expense types" with parameters empty.
Let "Review material" mean (record with ["claim" is (the value of "Current claim"), "findings" is (the value of "Check finding")]) as record with ["claim" as type "Claim" from "Expense types", "findings" as choice with ["clear" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "correction" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "duplicate" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types", "rejected" as type "Check evidence" from "Expense types"]] with parameters empty.
Let "Claim for correction" mean (record with ["claim" is (the value of "Current claim"), "reasons" is (the value of "Correction reasons")]) as record with ["claim" as type "Claim" from "Expense types", "reasons" as list of text] with parameters empty.
Let "Check is clear" mean ((the case of (the value of "Check finding")) equals ("clear")) as truth value with parameters empty.
Let "Check is correction" mean ((the case of (the value of "Check finding")) equals ("correction")) as truth value with parameters empty.
Let "Check is duplicate" mean ((the case of (the value of "Check finding")) equals ("duplicate")) as truth value with parameters empty.
Rule for work "Manager review rules". Instructions "Decide this exact claim and policy revision; record attributable reasons and current assignment. A deadline never supplies approval.". Authority "Manager". Attempts 1. Delays empty. Retry faults empty. Timeout none. Complete when (if ((the case of (the fact "result")) equals ("approved")) then (((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "approved"))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim")))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "approved"))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim"))))) and ((field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "approved"))) equals (field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim"))))) and (((field "principal" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "approved"))) equals (the fact "principal")) and (not ((the fact "principal") equals (field "employee" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim"))))))) otherwise (if ((the case of (the fact "result")) equals ("correction")) then (((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "correction"))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim")))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "correction"))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim"))))) and ((field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "correction"))) equals (field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim"))))) and (((field "principal" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "correction"))) equals (the fact "principal")) and (not ((the fact "principal") equals (field "employee" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim"))))))) otherwise (if ((the case of (the fact "result")) equals ("rejected")) then (((((field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "rejected"))) equals (field "claim ID" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim")))) and ((field "claim revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "rejected"))) equals (field "revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim"))))) and ((field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "rejected"))) equals (field "policy revision" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim"))))) and (((field "principal" of (the representation of (the payload of (the fact "result") for "rejected"))) equals (the fact "principal")) and (not ((the fact "principal") equals (field "employee" of (the representation of (the value of "Current claim"))))))) otherwise (false)))). Compensates none. End policy.
Step "Manager review". Ask "Manager" to decide using "Review material" under "Manager review rules" and record in "Manager result". On "approved", continue with "Record manager approval". On "correction", continue with "Record manager correction". On "rejected", continue with "Record manager rejection". End step.
